    {
      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "3.1 grams of fat. Saturated fat is only 0.5 grams, a strong mark that keeps the fat profile light. Omega 3 is 100 milligrams, far too little to make farro a useful omega 3 source. Fat is not a grain's main job, but this section is clean rather than powerful.",
